NOTICE

Clinical data

MIMIC-III is PhysioNet credentialed data. It is not distributed here, in whole or in
part, and it is not redistributable by this project. No clinical note text and no
patient identifier of any kind (no HADM_ID, no SUBJECT_ID, no admission or subject
key under any other name) appears anywhere in this repository. Every clinical
intermediate is held outside version control, under a single credentialed local
directory named by the MIMIC_LOCAL_ONLY_DIR environment variable, and nothing under
that directory is tracked. What this repository commits from the clinical strand is
aggregate statistics, or per pair outputs keyed only to internal sequential indices.
Reproducing the clinical results therefore requires the reader's own PhysioNet
credentialed access to MIMIC-III, obtained directly from PhysioNet under its own data
use agreement. The pharmacist's gold labels are themselves derived from credentialed
data; they are distributed neither here nor by PhysioNet, so the results that depend
on them can be checked against the committed aggregates but cannot be regenerated by
a third party. See README.md for the directory layout the clinical scripts expect.

Third party models and corpora

This project uses the following third-party models and corpora.

Built with Meta Llama 3

Llama 3 8B (`llama3:8b`, served locally through Ollama) is used as a weak-supervision
labeller in this project (see `accord/differential/run_multillm_replication.py`,
and `accord/prevalence_replication/run_prevalence_sweep.py`). Use of Llama 3 is subject to the Meta
Llama 3 Community License; the attribution above is included per section 1.b of that
license.

